{'symbol': 'INTU', 'date': '2023-02-15 08:30:00', 'title': 'INTUIT TO INFUSE $1M INTO LOCAL COMMUNITIES WITH SUPPORT TO SMALL BUSINESSES AND NONPROFITS', 'text': "MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTUIT (NASDAQ: INTU), THE GLOBAL FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY PLATFORM THAT MAKES TURBOTAX, CREDIT KARMA, QUICKBOOKS, AND MAILCHIMP, ANNOUNCED TODAY ITS FIRST EVER ‘SMALL BUSINESS BIG IMPACT DAY' ON FEBRUARY 15, DEDICATED TO UNITING EMPLOYEES FOR THE PURPOSE OF STRENGTHENING AND GIVING BACK TO LOCAL COMMUNITIES. INTUIT HAS PURCHASED $1 MILLION-WORTH OF ITEMS DIRECTLY FROM LOCAL SMALL BUSINESSES THAT WILL BE DONATED TO LOCAL NONPROFITS."}